  "notes": "Both images show the same RP2350-ETH-8DI-8RO pinout artwork (image 2 is a smaller rendering); connectors transcribed from each image separately. Labels are the callout names; silkscreen spellings (38, G, TXD, SCL, IO37, CLK, DIO) put first in functions. Screw terminals and relay terminals carry no pin labels in the images and are skipped. The 6-pin header above the 2x14 header is labeled only by silkscreen 1 2 3 4 + -; the silkscreen marks are used as labels."
